{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51040","headline":"禅诗 五 · 无名僧","name":"禅诗 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"即日一千僧，住在寺山林。\n百鸟同科宿，相看见兄弟。\n（此首原注出伯二六三三卷。\n末句「兄弟」，疑应作「弟兄」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名僧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}